00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:24.080
in the underlying names over the prior 30 sessions. Retail investors who pair the flow alerts

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:29.920
with the same day volume check on the underlying stock lower the odds of acting on noise instead of

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:38.340
sustained institutional interest. Friday US payrolls printed at 162,000 against a 55,000 consensus,

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:43.480
