00:06:55.660 --> 00:07:01.460
shape that has historically preceded policy tightening rather than growth concerns. Action is to

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:08.060
reduce duration and fixed income ETFs held inside RRSP accounts until the next Fed decision

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:14.080
